item><title>AI 监管机构表示，OpenAI 发布的最新模型可能违反了加州的 AI 安全法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/openai-may-have-violated-californias-ai-safety-law-with-astra-model-releases-ai-watchdog-says/</link><description>该监管组织表示，OpenAI 今年发布的任何模型都没有遵守法律。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292627005-e1789393316328.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:41:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/openai-may-have-violated-californias-ai-safety-law-with-astra-model-releases-ai-watchdog-says/</guid></item><item><title>员工的焦虑如何伪装成绩效，然后适得其反</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/how-employee-anxiety-masquerades-as-performance-then-backfires/</link><description>博雅最近的一项研究显示，一半的劳动力表示，对世界状况的焦虑正在损害他们的注意力。但情况更复杂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/stacey-zolt-hara.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/how-employee-anxiety-masquerades-as-performance-then-backfires/</guid></item><item><title>华尔街的人工智能末日交易已经到来：芯片制造商陷入困境，而超大规模企业却获利</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/ai-slowdown-stocks-nvidia-meta/</link><description>英伟达股价下跌超过 3%，而 Meta、微软和 Alphabet 则上涨，因为投资者开始将需要无尽人工智能资本支出的公司与那些可以通过削减资本支出来获利的公司区分开来。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295226898-e1789398676972.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:26:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/ai-slowdown-stocks-nvidia-meta/</guid></item><item><title>AGIBOT联合创始人姚茂庆表示，人形机器人将在5年内迎来“GPT-3.5”时刻</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/humanoids-gpt-3-5-moment-agibot/</link><description>机器人舞蹈表演占据了头条新闻，但中国的人形机器人制造商正在竞相寻找在酒店和工厂的真正用途。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55515292424_84848b1763_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:15:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/humanoids-gpt-3-5-moment-agibot/</guid></item><item><title>迈克尔·戴尔 (Michael Dell) 现在是世界第五大富豪——得益于人工智能，仅去年一年他的身家就几乎翻了一番，达到 2620 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/michael-dell-net-worth-nearly-doubled-262-billion-last-year-alone-dell-becomes-unexpected-ai-infrastructure-winner/</link><description>迈克尔·戴尔在人工智能方面的成功使他超越了马克·扎克伯格和拉里·埃里森等科技大亨的财富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2076701879-e1789397307951.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:58:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/michael-dell-net-worth-nearly-doubled-262-billion-last-year-alone-dell-becomes-unexpected-ai-infrastructure-winner/</guid></item><item><title>美联航首席执行官将每天的会议时间限制为 4 小时，并对 PowerPoint 演示有严格的规定：“你不能给我读幻灯片”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/united-ceo-scott-kirby-strict-meeting-cap-no-powerpoint-readouts-reads-three-hours-a-day-airline-industry-success/</link><description>美联航首席执行官斯科特·柯比（Scott Kirby）保持日程安排精简，让自己有更多时间思考——他每天花 3 个小时阅读报纸、杂志和科幻小说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291482606-e1789396788892.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:53:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/united-ceo-scott-kirby-strict-meeting-cap-no-powerpoint-readouts-reads-three-hours-a-day-airline-industry-success/</guid></item><item><title>Hugging Face 联合创始人表示，越来越难判断哪家公司将赢得人工智能竞赛</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/hugging-face-thomas-wolf-brainstormai-ai-models-advanced-benchmarks/</link><description>Hugging Face 的托马斯·沃尔夫 (Thomas Wolf) 表示，随着传统人工智能基准变得饱和，要判断哪种人工智能模型最好变得越来越困难。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/54501800783_e51f2087c1_c.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 09:49:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/hugging-face-thomas-wolf-brainstormai-ai-models-advanced-benchmarks/</guid></item></channel></rss>